tyle=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>3. Where can I find the College List for the UP DGMHUP ANM Training Admission?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed of College List and Admission scheme for the UP DGMHUP ANM Training Admission are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete syllabus details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>4. UP DGMHUP ANM Training Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>5. UP DGMHUP ANM Training Admission Last Date?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>31 July 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>6. What is the last date to Update application fee Details?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">31 July 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>7. How can I apply for UP DGMHUP ANM Training Admission?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_25790\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-25790\" style=\"width: 2550px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-25790\" title=\"UP DGMHUP ANM Training\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UP-DGMHUP-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"UP DGMHUP\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1502\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UP-DGMHUP-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UP-DGMHUP-300x176.jpg 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UP-DGMHUP-1024x601.jpg 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UP-DGMHUP-768x451.jpg 768w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UP-DGMHUP-1536x901.jpg 1536w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/UP-DGMHUP-2048x1202.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-25790\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">UP DGMHUP 2026</figcaption></figure>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Main Pajes 2 -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
